--- WHAM_files (US_inter_alpha) ---

Shared WHAM scripts for all five interconversion reconstructions in USW_100_*/repN/WHAM/:
'wham1D.py' (copied from the MareNostrum 5 pph4 project -- see LFER_3_mg2/pph4/PMF_react_TS1/
WHAM_files/README for what it does), 'errors_wham1D.py' its error-estimation companion, and a
Vives-adapted 'job_wham.sh' (see ../README for the exact adaptation: 'cuerda' qos/partition,
'wham_miguel' conda environment).

Note: this README documents pre-existing content; no existing file was modified.
